                    {
                        "sense_id": "98cce278-af86-32b9-9654-60f8e715c5e9",
                        "entry_id": "22c434fa-61f1-3a99-9de7-8d92ae12dcb0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to play pranks, to make mischief"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b25bdfb-22b2-480b-81e1-48a73978743a",
                                "sense_id": "98cce278-af86-32b9-9654-60f8e715c5e9",
                                "text": "Е́сли Кири́лл Ильи́ч и куде́сил в мо́лодости, то, жени́вшись, не то́лько остепени́лся, но поступи́л на госуда́рственную слу́жбу[...]",
                                "translation": "Even if Kirill Ilyich had been pretty wild in his youth, once married he not only settled down but also entered government service…",
                                "english": "Even if Kirill Ilyich had been pretty wild in his youth, once married he not only settled down but also entered government service…"
                            }
                        ]
